#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:210
msgid ""
"Drop the ``scale=(min, max)`` keyword from :func:`fir.draw_ir` and use the "
"new arguments (:ref:`the draw_ir change <v3_9_0_fir_draw_ir>`)."
msgstr ""
"احذف الكلمة المفتاحية ``scale=(min, max)`` من :func:`fir.draw_ir` واستخدم "
"الوسائط الجديدة (\\ :ref:`تغيير draw_ir <v3_9_0_fir_draw_ir>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.9.0.rst:212
msgid ""
"Re-tune ``find_lines()`` parameters against the approximate magnitude metric"
